{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36983","headline":"送卢端公归台卢校书之夏县 · 罗隐","name":"送卢端公归台卢校书之夏县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绵绵堤草拂征轮，龙虎俱辞楚水滨。\n只是胜之爲御史，不知梅福是仙人。\n地推八米源流盛，才笑三张事业贫。\n一种西归一般达，柏台霜冷夏城春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}